WEBVTT

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.530
<b>New Album</b>

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.160
Hey! You've reached Mari!

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.520
I can't answer the phone right now.

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:45.840
Please leave a message after the tone!

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:50.220
Mari-san, our meeting's begun.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:52.040
<b>New Album</b>

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:52.040
Can you call me?

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:54.340
No luck?

00:01:54.340 --> 00:01:56.920
Lately, she's been acting strangely...

00:01:57.470 --> 00:02:01.630
Well, she's always been a bit eccentric 
when she's composing.

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:04.430
But this time, she's been having mood swings.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:06.430
She'll start laughing for no reason,

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:08.590
and then she gets really low.

00:02:09.430 --> 00:02:11.280
Did something happen?

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:14.940
<b>Idol Devastation</b>

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:25.700
Someone!

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:28.620
Wait!

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:38.550
Bastard!

00:02:40.510 --> 00:02:41.390
<i>Samurai Punch!</i>

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:51.230
You have nothing to worry about, ma'am.

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:53.970
Thank you!

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:57.740
<b>Mysterious Hero Saves the Day 
Samurai Flamenco Punishes Purse Snatcher</b>

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:02.380
Look... I caught a purse snatcher!

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:08.500
Considering how you started, 
you've come a long way.

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:12.180
Recently, I haven't been getting hit as much.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:13.250
Well done!

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:16.500
Your training has paid off.

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:18.510
Yes! Absolutely!

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:23.110
You weren't lacking physical strength,

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:25.000
and your reflexes are sharp.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.670
Thank you very much.

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:29.290
Under the tutelage of a talented instructor, me,

00:03:29.290 --> 00:03:31.200
your potential has been realized.

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:32.640
It's that simple.

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.650
You have my eternal respect!

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.150
Don't get cocky!

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:43.530
<i>Huh? Why?</i>

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:46.680
You've only started down the path of justice.

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:48.540
There isn't a moment to spare!

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:52.410
F-Forgive me, master.

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:55.290
I'm glad you understand, student!

00:03:57.570 --> 00:03:58.320
Master...

00:03:58.320 --> 00:03:59.170
Student!

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:00.050
Master!

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:00.550
Student!

00:04:00.820 --> 00:04:01.650
Master!

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:02.550
Student!

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:05.800
<i>Has he forgotten Masayoshi's name?</i>

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:03.220
Master!

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:04.010
Student!

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:04.870
Master!

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:05.800
Student!

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:20.820
I'm considering patrolling the 
town of Numasaki next.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:22.680
Numasaki?

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:24.850
That's a dangerous area.

00:04:24.850 --> 00:04:27.070
Lots of people and crime.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:30.580
That's why justice must be served.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:34.030
No, it's too dangerous for you right now.

00:04:34.030 --> 00:04:39.610
That town is filled with those who are 
professionals at disrupting society.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:42.970
No need to worry, I shall accompany him.

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:46.460
If anything goes wrong, 
I'll be there to support you.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:47.970
You can count on me!

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:49.470
Master...

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:50.720
Student.

00:04:51.110 --> 00:04:52.020
Master!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:52.630
Student!

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:55.400
<i>When something goes wrong, 
don't say I didn't warn you.</i>

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:54.080
Master!

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:55.140
Student!

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.080
Master!

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:57.190
Student!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.090
Master!

00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.230
Student!

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:09.240
<b>From: Kaname-san 
To: Student 
Sub: No Subject</b>

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:05.820
<i>My apologies.</i>

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:09.240
<i>I received an offer from Hollywood, 
so I won't be able to join you.</i>

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:12.190
<i>Have no fear. You can do this!</i>

00:05:12.190 --> 00:05:14.650
<i>Strive to vanquish evil.</i>

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:16.000
<i>Master...</i>

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.510
Huh? Look...

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.480
Isn't that the guy from TV?

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:35.020
The one with Flamenco in his name?

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:37.280
Is there a camera around?

00:05:37.280 --> 00:05:38.270
Is he the real deal?

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:42.980
Uh...

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:46.030
I'm a fan...

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:47.750
Would you shake my hand?

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:49.000
Oh... Me, too!

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:51.410
Yes, of course.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.410
You rock!

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:58.170
I'm pulling for you!

00:05:58.170 --> 00:05:59.290
Yay!

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:04.360
E-Er...

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:07.070
Could you please put me down?

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:10.590
Thank you.

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:13.100
Then, I should go.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:14.520
He ran away!

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.470
After him!

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:20.140
Wait!

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:34.870
G-Guess I won't be able to patrol the area...

00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:37.620
It's too dangerous for you right now.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:41.120
I must do this!

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:47.080
It's empty...

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:47.880
Check the back.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:49.110
Let's see...

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:51.630
Well?

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:52.660
Stop!

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:56.410
The security cameras may not see you,

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:58.230
but justice is always watching!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:01.690
Samurai Flamenco has stellar eyesight!

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:04.690
Who is this? Some kind of freak?

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:06.650
Oh, I've seen him on the Internet.

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:09.030
Stop breaking into cars!

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:11.750
Uh, we own this car.

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:13.580
D-Don't lie!

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:15.880
What's your problem? Don't interrupt us...

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:16.990
Get a clue!

00:07:16.990 --> 00:07:19.370
I-If you refuse to cease your crimes,

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:21.580
you will face justice—

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:34.470
See? There's a reward posted for this guy.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.220
They're offering a million yen for his identity.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.810
A million? Awesome!

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:40.630
S-Stop this.

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:41.910
Oh, he woke up.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:43.910
What are you doing? Release me...

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:45.310
Cease this foolishness!

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:48.010
Pretty sure that you're the fool here.

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:56.620
Hey, get this on camera.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:57.950
Okay.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.330
A million yen! A million yen!

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:11.210
Don't struggle...

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:13.720
Or I might cut your face.

00:08:17.730 --> 00:08:18.600
What?

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:28.560
Sorry to keep you waiting, Samurai Flamenco.

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:35.990
Wh-Who are you?

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:38.660
My baton is used to inject love!

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:41.870
They call me...

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.500
Flamenco Girl!

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:48.020
Flamenco Girl?

00:08:57.520 --> 00:08:58.890
Wh-What?!

00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:03.130
<i>Saber Change!</i>

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:04.430
Hey!

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:10.800
It's hurtin' time!

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:19.620
Promise you'll be good from now on?

00:09:22.730 --> 00:09:24.450
I don't believe you!

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:33.260
I'll just take this.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:52.160
Let's go.

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:54.850
Who are you?

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:02.010
And them?

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:04.290
It's okay, I called the cops.

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:11.790
You should worry about your own 
injuries first, Samumenco.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:12.980
Samumen?!

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:14.510
Then, Hazama-kun.

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.790
H-How did you know?

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.300
Oh, you really are Masayoshi-kun!

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:21.800
Who are you?

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:30.310
Maya Mari?

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:44.620
<b>Flamenco ran toward 
the Yamato building. 

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:51.040
What's that guy doing?

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:57.240
You can remove that.

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:07.480
Over here.

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:13.150
You're...

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:15.110
just like me!

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:17.320
Wrong!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:20.410
You're like me!

00:11:22.300 --> 00:11:25.150
For a long time, I've prepared for this day.

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:27.580
I worked secretly, so no one would find out.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:29.990
I had this baton custom-made,

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:32.670
and I've been hitting the gym.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:36.850
But then you came out of nowhere!

00:11:37.680 --> 00:11:40.370
And ruined all my preparation.

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:44.580
If I debut now, everyone will think I'm a copycat.

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:46.040
H-How is that my fault—

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:49.030
If I hadn't failed the written portion of 
the driver's license test seven times,

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:50.980
I would have beaten you to the punch.

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:53.100
Okay, it doesn't matter.

00:11:54.240 --> 00:11:56.550
I just had a great idea.

00:11:58.510 --> 00:11:59.630
Let's team up.

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:00.850
Team up?

00:12:00.850 --> 00:12:02.930
Just do what you did today...

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:04.990
Draw the attention of any bad guys,

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:07.480
then fail and get captured.

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:09.140
I didn't get captured on purpose...

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:13.370
Then I'll show up to save you 
and defeat the bad guys.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:14.250
Perfect, right?

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:17.980
No way! I'll look like an idiot!

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:19.500
Not my problem.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:21.010
I'm stronger than you.

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:24.940
You were using cheap shots...

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:26.140
That isn't how a hero fights.

00:12:26.500 --> 00:12:28.600
Oh? Is your memory that bad?

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:33.140
If I hadn't shown up, your face would 
be all over the internet right now.

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:36.900
Refuse and I'll reveal your identity.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:39.700
Shouldn't you worry about your 
identity being exposed, too?

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:42.530
Yes, but that's irrelevant.

00:12:43.160 --> 00:12:46.910
I'm sick of holding myself back every day.

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:50.660
Isn't that how you feel, Samumenco?

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.680
It's Samurai Flamenco!

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:58.920
Fine.

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:00.420
Let's team up.

00:13:01.020 --> 00:13:01.920
Yay!

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:04.760
Well, I guess we're both fighting evil...

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:07.010
We should be able to work together.

00:13:09.060 --> 00:13:11.390
You're supposed to thank your new leader.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.140
Right?

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:18.520
<b>Flamenco Girl Makes a Splash! 
Who Is She? First Sighting</b>

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:16.780
<i>Wait!</i>

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:18.960
<i>Huh? Who are you?</i>

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.680
<i>H-Help!</i>

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:21.820
<i>Hold it right there!</i>

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.190
<i>F-Flamenco Girl!</i>

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:26.360
<i>I'll take it from here, Samumenco.</i>

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:28.110
<i>Y-You saved me.</i>

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:30.720
<i>Shooting Step!</i>

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.750
<i>Th-Thank you.</i>

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:43.170
<b>Flamenco Girl Makes a Splash! 
Who Is She? Second Sighting</b>

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:46.170
<b>Flamenco Girl Makes a Splash! 
Who Is She? Third Sighting</b>

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:46.260
<i>People who gang up on helpless girls</i>

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:50.160
<i>get a taste of my justice!</i>

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:52.770
<i>They call me</i>

00:13:53.160 --> 00:13:54.720
<i>Flamenco Girl!</i>

00:13:56.330 --> 00:13:58.140
<i>Uh, please take this.</i>

00:13:58.140 --> 00:13:59.480
<i>Ah, thank you...</i>

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:04.450
<i>Here you go, boss lady!</i>

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:05.820
<i>Nice work!</i>

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.830
<b>Flamenco Girl</b>

00:14:12.320 --> 00:14:22.700
<i>Flamenco Girl! Flamenco Girl!</i>

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.330
<b>1st Flamenco Girl 
2nd Samumenco 
3rd 100-million reward</b>

00:14:22.700 --> 00:14:25.090
What is he trying to do?

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:27.090
Good morning!

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:31.340
Good morning, Mari-san.

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:34.410
The past week, what have you been doing?

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:36.260
We have an album to finish...

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:38.600
Did you finish a new song?

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:41.070
I have seventy songs there.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:42.110
Huh?

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:44.730
Moe-chan, you always look so cute.

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:48.240
That's that.

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:49.900
Boss!

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:51.180
Let's do a performance in a dome!

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:52.830
A dome!

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:56.010
Something's up with her.

00:14:56.420 --> 00:14:59.460
Yes, that one was longer than usual.

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:02.880
Masayoshi-kun, you look tired.

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:05.880
No, I'm fine...

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:08.630
Just a little while ago, you were full of energy.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:11.610
Right, look at how energetic I am.

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.160
Look.

00:15:15.220 --> 00:15:16.320
Very well.

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:20.580
Anyway, this isn't set in stone, 
but you have a TV drama offer.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:22.550
It's a great opportunity,

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:25.870
<i>Somehow, things haven't felt right...</i>

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:24.840
but I want you to think hard before accepting.

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:28.460
I'll be heading out, then.

00:15:28.460 --> 00:15:31.340
H-Hold on... You aren't on duty tomorrow, right?

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:32.680
Take this with you.

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.030
What's that?

00:15:34.650 --> 00:15:37.630
A memo the PR unit is circulating.

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:39.410
I just got the e-mail...

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:40.960
I don't really need to read it.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:43.040
<b>When dealing with Flamenco Girl and her 
partner, exercise caution and vigilance.</b>

00:15:45.430 --> 00:15:48.020
"This month, the force has received many calls

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:54.920
concerning the recent emergence of 
Samurai Flamenco and Flamenco Girl.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:59.250
A majority of calls come from grateful citizens.

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:03.360
But there are also complaints about excessive 
force, use of dangerous weaponry,

00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:06.060
and general disruptions being caused.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:09.300
Currently, no claims have been filed.

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:12.140
But to prepare for any possible future claims,

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:18.130
we ask that officers please track 
any sightings in their precincts.

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:22.500
Prevent crime by keeping your doors 
locked and your heads down."

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:25.890
Good grief.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.840
<b>I have to cancel our 
date tomorrow. 
Sorries.</b>

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:38.030
Thanks!

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.940
<b>You suck! (T_T) 

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.600
<b>You suck! (T_T) 

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.700
<b>What about Samurai Flamenco?

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.610
<b>Tagging along, as usual! 

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:03.290
Die!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:10.360
I don't really get the whole 
"good versus evil" thing,

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:13.430
but I do think bad guys deserve to die.

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:18.320
Thank you for saving me, Flamenco Girl.

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.100
Uh...

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:27.610
Every journey must be taken step by step!

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:28.940
The quest for justice is...

00:17:29.330 --> 00:17:29.940
Go—

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:30.940
Go?

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:35.040
G-Good night!

00:17:35.040 --> 00:17:36.140
Hold it right there!

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:38.170
What? What's happening?!

00:17:45.940 --> 00:17:48.210
What are you trying to do?

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:50.250
That hurts... You're hurting me, Goto-san.

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.800
You're the reason I lost my day off!

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:53.990
Hey...

00:17:53.990 --> 00:17:55.410
Who are you?

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:56.470
He's Goto-san.

00:17:57.020 --> 00:17:58.470
Eh? Who's that?

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:02.220
It's this bad?

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:03.790
You've had your fun...

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:05.600
It's time to stop.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:07.340
You can only play hero for so long.

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:08.850
We aren't "playing" hero!

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.050
We're serious!

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:12.730
No one else is here to help these 
people, so we're stepping in.

00:18:12.970 --> 00:18:14.240
Two of you now?

00:18:14.240 --> 00:18:16.370
It's for the police to handle these situations!

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:19.000
Come on... Help me out here!

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:21.740
Hey.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.740
We aren't playing hero.

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:27.950
We're very serious.

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:30.690
We're still trying to get our footing,

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:32.880
but we're serious about doing good!

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:36.390
You haven't given up on that yet?

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:37.870
Look over here...

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.380
I thought I heard voices!

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.040
S-Sorry...

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:43.350
We need to go!

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:45.260
Wait, I'm not done with you.

00:18:48.420 --> 00:18:50.020
G-Goto-san!

00:18:50.390 --> 00:18:52.190
This is our chance to escape.

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:53.520
You fools...

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.850
If we don't leave, they'll catch us.

00:18:55.850 --> 00:18:58.110
Goto-san... I'm sorry!

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.600
Y-You can't be serious...

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:04.780
When I find you, you're gonna pay...

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.040
<b>Why do you ask? 

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.830
<b>Wasn't that why you had to cancel? 

00:19:12.830 --> 00:19:13.790
<b>Wasn't that why you had to cancel? 

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.340
<b>Recently, you're always 
talking about him. 

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:20.060
I said I don't wanna do it...

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:22.570
No, you have to apologize!

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:23.710
Let me go!

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:24.410
I won't!

00:19:26.200 --> 00:19:26.890
Goto-san...

00:19:27.240 --> 00:19:28.470
H-Hi...

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:31.250
Don't block my punch, you twit.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:32.600
I'm sorry.

00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:36.110
I'm very sorry for what happened yesterday.

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:43.680
But all three of us are trying 
to keep this town safe...

00:19:44.170 --> 00:19:46.240
There must be a way for us to work together.

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:47.630
Huh?

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:50.090
I understand she's taken it too far.

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:51.580
She's been too brutal.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:53.500
At times, I've found myself 
questioning her motives.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.590
Hey!

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:58.840
However, the fact remains that 
we've been preventing crime.

00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:02.450
She's helped save many women 
who might have been victims!

00:20:04.630 --> 00:20:07.970
Can't we work together, Goto-san?

00:20:09.390 --> 00:20:10.700
I'm a cop.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:15.270
If I get a complaint, I'll come and arrest you.

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:18.950
So do your fighting when we aren't watching.

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:20.650
If you want to keep the peace.

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:21.960
Yes!

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:28.210
Anyway, why is that girl 
standing there, staring at me?

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:32.040
Mari-san? What's wrong?

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:36.420
U-Um, er...

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.050
I'm sorry for yesterday!

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:40.370
Sorry!

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:43.300
Sorry about the uniform!

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:45.960
<i>I had no idea.</i>

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:50.040
<i>I didn't think he'd look so good in a uniform!</i>

00:22:26.430 --> 00:22:29.410
Can we take this song off the list?

00:22:29.410 --> 00:22:34.620
Mari's uniform fetish is a serious problem...

00:22:35.010 --> 00:22:38.050
Wait, over half of the songs are like this?

00:22:38.620 --> 00:22:43.370
Please investigate my heart

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:50.050
<b>The Meaning of Justice</b>

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:55.950
<b>We'll Be Cheering You On Next Time, Too</b>

00:22:55.950 --> 00:22:57.950
<b></b>
